            <li><strong>Typical Horizon:</strong> 7 to 10+ years with illiquid lock-ins and milestone-based follow-on rounds.</li>
            <li><strong>Tax Structure:</strong> Pass-through status under Section 115UB (income taxed in hands of investor as if received directly).</li>
