            <li><strong>Typical Horizon:</strong> 4 to 7 years with structured distribution waterfalls (hurdle rate + carry).</li>
            <li><strong>Tax Structure:</strong> Pass-through status under Section 115UB. Business income is taxed at the fund level at MMR.</li>
          </ul>
